{
    "title": "\u06a9\u0648\u06cc\u06cc\u0632 - \u0628\u0627\u0632\u06cc \u0627\u0637\u0644\u0627\u0639\u0627\u062a \u0639\u0645\u0648\u0645\u06cc",
    "description": "An attractive game + a great social network!!! \ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\r\n\r\nThe quiz is designed so that you can challenge your general knowledge...\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in increasing your level of knowledge or if you like to test your general knowledge, go here\r\n\r\nIn the quiz you can:\r\nParticipate in special events with millions of prizes\r\nPlay with your friends or with random opponents \u270c\ufe0f\r\nIf you have a high action speed, you can test your speed in the league and win prizes \u2640\ufe0f \ud83c\udfc3\r\nIf you have skills in a certain area, you can prove your skills in the league and learn even more\r\n\r\nThis is just the beginning\r\n\r\nQuiz is added to one of the largest Iranian social networks, Ham social network \ud83d\udca5\r\nIt means that you can log in here with the same account and you can create an account in the quiz and connect to the big world with the same account.\r\nYou can collect coins here and spend it together or vice versa!\r\nYou can communicate with your opponents and those you play with, that is, you can chat with them, send posts, and a thousand other possibilities...",
    "descriptionHTML": "An attractive game + a great social network!!! \ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5<br><br>The quiz is designed so that you can challenge your general knowledge...<br><br>If you are interested in increasing your level of knowledge or if you like to test your general knowledge, go here<br><br>In the quiz you can:<br>Participate in special events with millions of prizes<br>Play with your friends or with random opponents \u270c\ufe0f<br>If you have a high action speed, you can test your speed in the league and win prizes \u2640\ufe0f \ud83c\udfc3<br>If you have skills in a certain area, you can prove your skills in the league and learn even more<br><br>This is just the beginning<br><br>Quiz is added to one of the largest Iranian social networks, Ham social network \ud83d\udca5<br>It means that you can log in here with the same account and you can create an account in the quiz and connect to the big world with the same account.<br>You can collect coins here and spend it together or vice versa!<br>You can communicate with your opponents and those you play with, that is, you can chat with them, send posts, and a thousand other possibilities...",
